      "body": {
        "text": "Bring on baby’s first foods! 🍐🍓🥑🥚\n\nIf you thought your baby needed a purée for their first food… guess again. \n\nBabies can start with almost any food as long as it is appropriately prepared according to their age.\n\nLet’s be clear: Purées aren’t bad—and there’s nothing wrong with serving them. They’re just not a required first step before finger foods. In fact, forget everything you’ve heard about “steps” or “stages”. They aren’t required. \n\nThe goal? Give baby safe opportunities to explore different tastes, textures, shapes, and smells while learning the skills needed to eat.\n\n➡️ Ok so how do you get started? Tap the link in our bio for your free seven day trial of the Solid Starts app, to take all the guesswork out of this new phase. 🤍\n\n#babyledweaning #firstfoods #solidstarts #6months #blwtips"
      },
